# Dockerfile.ci — ubuntu:24.04 mirroring CI (GTK 4.14, glib 2.74)
# Runs Artha's ASan and Valgrind lanes inside a container so the host
# is never mutated (ground rule 8: no system packages, no ~/.config).
#
# Build:
#   docker build -t artha-ci -f Dockerfile.ci .
#
# Run ASan lane:
#   docker run --rm -v "$(pwd):/artha" -v "$HOME/.artha-cache:/root/.artha-cache" -w /artha artha-ci /artha/tools/ci-asn.sh
#
# Run Valgrind lane:
#   docker run --rm -v "$(pwd):/artha" -v "$HOME/.artha-cache:/root/.artha-cache" -w /artha artha-ci /artha/tools/ci-valgrind.sh

FROM ubuntu:24.04

ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive

# Build deps for Artha + ASan lane (clang) + Valgrind lane (valgrind + glibc debuginfo)
# All pinned to ubuntu:24.04 package versions — matches CI's glib 2.74 / GTK 4.14.
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
        build-essential \
        clang \
        libgtk-4-dev \
        libglib2.0-dev \
        libx11-dev \
        wordnet-dev \
        valgrind \
        libc6-dbg \
        pkg-config \
        git \
        curl \
        ca-certificates \
        xz-utils \
        python3 \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

WORKDIR /artha

# Go-task is not available in ubuntu:24.04 repos; install the binary directly.
RUN ARCH="$(dpkg --print-architecture)" && \
    curl -fsSL "https://github.com/go-task/task/releases/download/v3.36.0/task_linux_${ARCH}.tar.gz" \
        -o /tmp/task.tar.gz && \
    tar -xzf /tmp/task.tar.gz -C /usr/local/bin && \
    rm -f /tmp/task.tar.gz
